irst image)\n- Primarina (Ashirene) with a face similar to the pose: https://x.com/takuan3737/status/1867154586211123542\n- Mienshao (Kojondo) with a surprised face: https://x.com/Akihuzi_tform/status/1774007429631729842\n- Meowscarada (Masquernya) with a worried face. You can draw this one however you please!\n\nThank you for the opportunity!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Happy_Hardc0re/works/79", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/def7c67e/uploads/origins/70cb7e3b-49e2-452e-813a-710bc10d06a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e708b5586e6fb0a9f4c63683760cf505", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/def7c67e/uploads/origins/70cb7e3b-49e2-452e-813a-710bc10d06a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e708b5586e6fb0a9f4c63683760cf505, https://si.imgix.net/def7c67e/uploads/origins/70cb7e3b-49e2-452e-813a-710bc10d06a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d938e549778e0c222abc541032a4e451 2x, https://si.imgix.net/def7c67e/uploads/origins/70cb7e3b-49e2-452e-813a-710bc10d06a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8694c09a8724618e16fa3d1c9739cfc4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "いつも作品、楽しみにさせて頂いております。\nリクエストなのですが、Elastigirlの平面化絵をお願いしたいです。\n参考URLのような、カクカクした平面化の感じでお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://x.com/squash_trap/status/1764109240653041999/photo/1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Happy_Hardc0re/works/78", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9f758b15/uploads/origins/0968cf16-f0f9-41ed-a337-3473112e2ca7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=511fd64793a4bc1753ddff482b856d01", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9f758b15/uploads/origins/0968cf16-f0f9-41ed-a337-3473112e2ca7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=